<title>FRANCE: CMAG says it is candidate for CMG privatisation.</title>
<headline>CMAG says it is candidate for CMG privatisation.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Compagnie Maritime des Antilles et de la Guyane (CMAG) said it had officially declared its candidacy for acquiring state-owned Compagnie Generale Maritime (CGM).</p>
<p>CMAG said its offer would safeguard the maritime transport of the antillian banana production, a sector with 20,000 jobs.</p>
<p>CMAG gave no details of its offer. It said it was open for discussions with other bidders.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
